                "text": "The Reducing Medically Unnecessary Delays in Care Act:\n\u27a1\ufe0f Requires that board-certified physicians in the same specialty make the decisions regarding patient treatment.\n\u27a1\ufe0fDirects Medicare, Medicare Advantage, and Medicare Part D plans to comply with requirements that restrictions must be based on medical necessity and written clinical criteria.\n\u27a1\ufe0f Institutes additional transparency obligations to hold insurance companies accountable for their prior authorization programs.\n\nRead more about my bill here:\n\nhttps://t.co/Qz5FNhLzor",
