                "retweet_count": 8,
                "source": "Twitter Web Client",
                "text": "I remember when my physician told me I had colon cancer, one of the deadliest forms of cancer in the United States. When it comes to cancer, early detection saves lives, but prior authorization can be a roadblock on the path to detection and treatment. That\u2019s why I\u2019m introducing my Reducing Medically Unnecessary Delays in Care Act of 2025. Read more about it in my op-ed: \n\nhttps://t.co/tVFY50hwZa",
